ecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,61,68,52,85,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1001502","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,61,68,52,85,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1001502","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[27,61,68,52,85,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1001502","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[27,61,68,52,85,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"11650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1001502","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[27,61,68,52,85,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"96","reputation":"11650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10018","armor":"WP1001502","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉中赵嵩之妻。初平二年，其夫赵嵩为故主复仇而死。张修垂涎其貌，张礼修以碧涂面，披头散发伪装疯癫，并暗藏利刃，以死相抗，终使贼人不敢侵犯。夫家衰败后，叔父因其年少劝其改嫁，慷慨以死为誓，坚决不从。张礼修侍奉凶恶的婆婆时毫无怨言，最终感化了婆婆，被乡人尊为“妇师”。","tc":"漢中趙嵩之妻。初平二年，其夫趙嵩為故主復仇而死。張修垂涎其貌，張禮修以碧涂面，披頭散發偽裝瘋癲，并暗藏利刃，以死相抗，終使賊人不敢侵犯。夫家衰敗后，叔父因其年少勸其改嫁，慷慨以死為誓，堅決不從。張禮修侍奉兇惡的婆婆時毫無怨言，最終感化了婆婆，被鄉人尊為“婦師”。","en":"Wife of Zhao Song of Hanzhong. In the second year of Chuping, her husband Zhao Song died attempting to avenge his former master. Zhang Xiu lusted after her beauty, but Zhang Lixiu smeared her face with green pigment, disheveled her hair to feign madness, and secretly concealed a sharp blade, resolved to fight to the death, which ultimately kept the villains from violating her. After her husband's family fell into decline, her uncle urged her to remarry due to her youth, but she impassionedly swore to die rather than consent. Serving her fierce mother-in-law without a word of complaint, she eventually moved her mother-in-law's heart and was revered by the local villagers as a ‘Model of Womanhood’.","jp":"漢中の趙嵩の妻。初平二年、夫の趙嵩が旧主の仇討ちで命を落とすと、張修がその美貌に目をつけた。張礼修は顔に青い塗料を塗り、髪を乱して狂人を装い、刃を隠し持って死を賭して抵抗したため、賊も手出しができなかった。夫の家が没落したのち、叔父がその若さを惜しんで再嫁を勧めたが、死を誓って毅然と拒絶した。また、気性の荒い姑に仕えても怨み言一つ言わず、ついにはその心を感化させたため、郷里の人々から「婦師」と尊崇された。","kr":"한중 사람 조숭의 아내. 초평 2년, 남편 조숭이 옛 주군의 원수를 갚다 목숨을 잃었다. 장수가 미모를 탐내자, 얼굴에 푸른 칠을 하고 머리를 풀어헤친 채 미치광이 행세를 하였으며, 품에 비수를 품고 죽음으로써 맞서 끝내 도적이 감히 범하지 못하게 하였다. 시댁이 몰락한 후 숙부가 젊은 나이를 이유로 개가를 권하였으나, 죽음을 맹세하며 결연히 따르지 않았다. 사나운 시어머니를 모시면서도 원망 한 점 없었으며, 끝내 시어머니를 감화시켜 고을 사람들로부터 '부사(婦師)'라 칭송받았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1034515","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"礼修","nameTc":"禮修","nameEn":"Lixiu","nameJp":"礼修","nameKr":"예수","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张礼修","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1036","gender":"1","rule":"27","force":"61","wise":"68","politics":"52","charm":"85","will":"89","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"60/15/70/15/56/43/51/15","battleAttri